  "notes": "Weekly price is the Program member rate; Family members pay $465. Camp 8:30 am to 4:30 pm at the Robert and Virginia Bauer Family Branch. Membership required for traditional camps (Family or Program member); there is no non-member rate. Before and after care available for a fee. Families pack a nut free lunch and two snacks. Deposit $100 a session. Financial aid for traditional camps is for families who live or work in Cranford, Garwood, Mountainside or Westfield. Early bird (January 8 to 28) paid 2025 rates.",
